WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
You can do it properly.

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.900
But they went back to where they were,

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.160
and they opened up a lot of different plants —

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.340
energy plants, energy-producing plants.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.340
And they're doing well.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.140
I give Germany a lot of credit for that.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.120
They've said this is a disaster, what's happening.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:21.020
They were going, all green. All green is all bankrupt.

00:00:21.559 --> 00:00:25.620
That's what it represents. And it's not politically correct.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.820
I'll be very badly criticized for saying it,

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.760
but I'm here to tell the truth.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.099
I don't care. It doesn't matter to me.

00:00:32.099 --> 00:00:35.459
I'm in New York City. I'm feeling a lot safer.

00:00:35.459 --> 00:00:37.259
Crime — we're getting crime down.

00:00:37.259 --> 00:00:39.939
And by the way, speaking of crime, Washington, D.C.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.380
Washington, D.C.

